# Why is This Optimal?

We iterate through the alphabet in sorted order (`a` to `z`). Appending `freq[i] // 2` copies of each character guarantees the left half is already the smallest possible lexicographically, without any sorting step. Mirroring that left half preserves the palindrome property.

